'''Lords of Destruction DRAGON EMPERORS''' (超破壊大帝ドラゴンエンペラーズ, ''Chō Hakai Taitei Doragon Enperāzu'', '''Ultra-Destruction Great Dragon Emperors''') is one of the Rare Cat Capsule events in Battle Cats. This event was added December 21st, 2014 in [[The Battle Cats]]. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update|Version 2.2]].

To unlock this banner in [[The Battle Cats Unite!|The Battle Cats Unite]], the player has to clear [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Moon]] in the '''Japanese''' and '''International''' versions and [[India (Into the Future)|India]] in the '''Southeast Asia''' version.

