==Trivia==
*Up until [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.3 Update|Version 2.2.3]], this set only had 1 uber available at a time, and would switch between the sole available uber between appearances. It was the only set to use this system.
*This is the first Uber set in which all 6 (earlier) members received a True Form, while [[Megidora (Uber Rare Cat)|Megidora]] is one of the first ever Ubers that gained True Form.
*[[Sodom (Uber Rare Cat)|Sodom]] shares the same name with an ancient city that was destroyed by fire.
*[[Kamukura (Uber Rare Cat)|Kamukura]] looks very similar to Shenron from ''Dragon Ball''.
*[[Dioramos (Uber Rare Cat)|Dioramos]] is a big reference to one of Godzilla's worst enemies: ''Destoroyah''.
**Dioramos is also a reference to another PONOS game with the same name on the PS1.
*This is the first gacha set whose Legend Rare received a True Form.

